GNOME Rounded Blur, Ubuntu packaging
https://github.com/spencercnorton/gnome-rounded-blur

This repository is a downstream of kancko/gnome-rounded-blur
(https://github.com/kancko/gnome-rounded-blur), based on upstream commit
f3bfcc796e1214c1e1d4287ee35cb132ad8133f0, whose history it keeps unchanged.

src/rounded-blur-effect.c and src/rounded-blur-effect.h derive from
gnome-shell's src/shell-blur-effect.c and .h, Copyright 2019 Georges Basile
Stavracas Neto, extended upstream with a corner mask and exported under the
"Blur" GObject Introspection namespace.

